---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { articles } from '../../data/home';
import { withBase } from '../../utils/paths';

export function getStaticPaths() {
  return articles.map((article) => ({
    params: { slug: article.href.split('/').filter(Boolean).pop() },
    props: { article }
  }));
}

const { article } = Astro.props;
---
<BaseLayout title={`${article.title} · xuan.z 的个人笔记`} description={article.excerpt}>
  <article class="article-page shell">
    <a class="article-back" href={withBase('/articles/')}>← 返回文章</a>
    <p class="page-kicker">Essay</p>
    <h1>{article.title}</h1>
    <div class="article-meta"><time>{article.date}</time><span>·</span><span>正文内容待补充</span></div>
    <img class="article-hero-cover" src={withBase(article.cover)} alt="" />
    <div class="prose">
      <p>{article.excerpt}</p>
      <p>这里已经预留文章详情页结构。后续会接入 Astro Content Collection / MDX，让知识文章、目录、代码块、引用和项目链接都能保持统一排版。</p>
      <h2>为什么要做这件事</h2>
      <p>首页负责建立阅读入口，真正的知识密度放到文章页里。这样能保持首页克制，也能让长文拥有更舒适的阅读宽度和节奏。</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
